VIEWMODEL.md §3.3, VIEWMODEL.md T14: a filter naming a method is E1606 (filters); a field filter is not.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local record Item {
  label: String
  count: Int

  fn doubled(self) -> Int {
    return count * 2
  }
}

view Item {
  filters { doubled, count }
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E1606]  a/a.canon:13:13
  doubled is not a field of Item: filters name fields only

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
